Scoped sobel, prewitt, scharr and roberts video filters

The option table (common class: planes, scale, delta), the pix_fmts list, the
plane geometry of param_init, the filter_sobel, filter_prewitt, filter_scharr
and filter_roberts kernels, setup_3x3 with its avpriv_mirror borders and the
copy of planes outside the mask in filter_slice, as used by
src/video-sobel.ts and src/video-ops/{sobel,prewitt,scharr,roberts}.ts, follow
libavfilter/vf_convolution.c (pix_fmts, filter_prewitt, filter_roberts,
filter_scharr, filter_slice, param_init, filter_frame, common_options,
common_class, ff_vf_sobel, ff_vf_prewitt, ff_vf_roberts, ff_vf_scharr) and
libavfilter/convolution.h (setup_3x3, filter_sobel, ff_sobel_init), with
avpriv_mirror from libavutil/internal.h and the AV_OPT_TYPE_INT and
AV_OPT_TYPE_FLOAT handling of libavutil/opt.c (set_string_number, write_number).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
